{"4942660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Proxy", "steam_appid": 4942660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/05b36b8853966cbf269893324c888f2e.poster.avif?t=1787831941\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/05b36b8853966cbf269893324c888f2e.webm?t=1787831941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/05b36b8853966cbf269893324c888f2e.mp4?t=1787831941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrust Into Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The former president is dead, and his place falls to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do, it seems, is keep the country running—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >yet no document is ever trivial, and no signature comes without a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/f729cecc9d22c75b776fb5a8b3d52d2c.poster.avif?t=1787831941\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/f729cecc9d22c75b776fb5a8b3d52d2c.webm?t=1787831941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942660/extras/f729cecc9d22c75b776fb5a8b3d52d2c.mp4?t=1787831941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insider Trading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You always know before the market does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because, after all, the news breaks at your desk.</p><p cl